# Build scratch for the domain auth policy package (issue #5055, U14).
# scripts/stage-domain-auth.sh copies modules/domain-apps/superplane/auth/ here so
# `docker build` can reach it — the policy lives above this component's build
# context, which releases/build-image.sh pins. It is refreshed from the single
# maintained location on every run and must never be committed as a second
# editable copy; tests/test_auth.py asserts it is absent from the tree.
vendor/
